Z||000022||lennyb4||06-20-2000||01:57 PM||||You know theres only a couple of issues i have with this. Besides what i said earlier some things have been buggin the crap out of me all day. First off you keep talking about a 351 in a fiero? Also you mention that your kits are good for a LT-1 as well? Now your talking about two seperate beast with totally different set-ups. Im sorry but i feel the need for more info on the workings of this set-up. I do have a BSME and it could be done but i question the simplicity of it. You would need to create a totally seperate package for each motor / tranny set-up. If you tried to use the same plates, mounts, etc. for all the different configurations it would greatly reduce the stress features of the steel used. Im not saying that you havent done what you claim i am just asking for alittle more information.||||reg||1
