Z||000027||DaRkLoRD||06-20-2000||05:57 PM||||as a web provider.... I HIGHLY RECOMMEND STAYING AWAY FROM NETWORK SOLUTIONS!<P>they are twice as expensive as their closest competition (CoreNIC) and they claim ownership of your domains in the fine print of the contract... meaning they can revoke your domain at any time, and there's nothing you can do about it!<P>Joker.com is an excellent CoreNIC domain registrar, and they charge $12/year for a domain.. I use this for all my domain names, and they have excellent service.. I'm not in any way associated with them, except that I'm a satisfied customer..||||reg||13
