Z||000040||Archie||06-21-2000||07:27 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by V8 Mikie:<BR><B>Well folks, sorry to bring this SMOKIN hot thread to a close but, my goal wasn't completed. I guess archie really did leave. I'm sorry i didn't get a chance to piss him off.<BR>.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sorry to dis-appoint you Mikie. I've been here all along & I knew you were full of cr*p from the beginning.<P>You need to get your story a bit better next time and try to remember that most people that can put together a program like you claimed, can spell better than you can.<P>Archie<P><BR>Looks like the Joke is on you.<P>I don't know how to insert one of those "Smiley" symbols here.....but if I knew how I'd insert the one with a little face "laughing out loud" at you.<BR>||||reg||1
